    "description": {
      "content": "HTTP REST endpoints exposed by QuestDB on the default HTTP port (9000) for SQL execution, CSV import/export, table existence checks, runtime metrics, and the InfluxDB Line Protocol HTTP ingestion endpoint. Authentication is unauthenticated by default in the open-source build; QuestDB Enterprise supports HTTP Basic Authentication and TLS.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: QuestDB Documentation",
